          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Import export work covers sourcing, documentation, shipping, customs clearance and payment handling, and the safe way in is to learn the document trail through a job or a small trial shipment, verify every partner and never send money to someone you cannot check."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Learn documents and compliance, work with a freight forwarder or customs professional, test one product with a small order and verify customers and suppliers through official channels."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check official guidance and use banking channels, not personal transfers to strangers."
          }
        ]
      },
